createNestedList [SimTalk] - DataQueue
Creates a nested list in the DataStack or DataQueue designated by <Path>.
Remarks
The DataStack or DataQueue has to be of data type list, stack, queue, or table.
Plant Simulation moves existing entries down one position. When you specify an index, which is greater
than the greatet valid index, Plant Simulation places the entry at the first available position in the list,
regardless of the actual index, preventing gaps between entries.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.createNestedList([Name:string]) → list
Parameter
The optional parameter Name of data type string designates the name of the list to be created.
Return Value
The return value has the data type list.
Is the nested list (DataList, DataQueue, DataStack, or DataTable) that was created.
Example
MyDataStack.createNestedList("My Sublist")
SimTalk
